// Sought-encounter recipes (wave 3, engine half).
//
// A recipe names a figure card that exists in NO generic reach: the player
// pins one or two cards and cooks a window of a particular kind of work, and
// the named figure arrives. Recipes are DATA, era-neutral by construction —
// window needs key on activity families (work, generosity, beings, learning,
// meditation) and card kinds/tags, never on pack practice ids, so the same
// recipe answers in Chang'an and in the Garden. Figures act; they do not
// preach or grade (SPEC §3, §10.11); this adds REACHABILITY for authored
// rows, not new rows (SPEC §10.15).
{
  encounters: [
